# GD-13 (round 19, writer 10): E §2 "[K, E], evaluation window ... Observations in [K, E] are never read by the run at
# cut K": day K is plan. bank[r1] is dated 2026-03-10; at cut 2026-03-10 it isn't read (konto holds its opening,
# 100.00 PLN, as stated), and at the header's cut 2026-03-20 its 50.00 PLN, as stated, is konto's flows that day.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
source b "b"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank: observed
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

version st
  cite b
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-03-10
  covers konto
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 50.00 PLN) "r1"

ask atk: bal(konto, 2026-03-10) as known 2026-03-10
ask after: flows(konto, 2026-03-10 .. 2026-03-10)
=== expect
after: 50.00 PLN
  cut 2026-03-20
atk: 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-03-10
